274-## 3. Control-Packet Mapping
--
302-- tool regression or deterministic harness evaluation -> `Mock-tool evaluation report`
303-- bounded multi-view challenge -> `Debate / consensus comparison memo`
304-- prompt-stack rewrite or release audit -> `Prompt-stack release review`
305-- guide-chapter reflection or doc-to-runtime parity benchmark -> `Guide reflection benchmark memo`
306:- assembled prompt replay setup -> `Benchmark cohort manifest`
307:- assembled prompt replay runner-state verdict -> `Replay runner verdict sheet`
308:- assembled prompt replay suite summary -> `Replay suite verdict memo`
309-- governance-owned packet-floor audit or omission-sensitive review -> `Packet compliance report`
310-- versioned replay suite or benchmark cohort definition -> `Benchmark registry memo`
311-- context-pack sufficiency or stale-context review -> `Context sufficiency review memo`
312-- critique-loop quality or no-gain-loop review -> `Critique quality review memo`
313-- adaptation promotion or rollback gate -> `Adaptation promotion review memo`
314-- route, prioritization, or exploration scoring -> `Route-quality scorecard`
315-- repo-scale coding scenario and verification-running contract -> `Coding benchmark scenario memo`
316-- executed benchmark result or cohort verdict -> `Benchmark execution report`
317:- replay execution verdict -> `Replay suite verdict memo`
318-- context failure and substrate diagnosis -> `Context failure taxonomy memo`
319-- critique utility and refinement delta review -> `Critique utility scorecard`
320-- adaptation lifecycle and rollback state -> `Adaptation lifecycle state memo`
321-- route-switch and re-prioritization audit -> `Route re-prioritization audit memo`
322-- engineering proof packet with executed-vs-unexecuted state -> `Coding proof bundle memo`
323-- integrated promotion packet with confidence class -> `Release evidence bundle v2`
324-- telemetry trend and cohort-aware drift review -> `Telemetry trend memo`
325:- benchmark cohort identity and run-linkage packet -> `Benchmark cohort manifest`
326:- replay execution-sheet and runner linkage packet -> `Replay runner verdict sheet`
327-- context substrate scoring packet -> `Context substrate scorecard`
328-- critique delta and no-gain logging packet -> `Critique delta ledger`
329-- adaptation controller audit packet -> `Adaptation controller audit packet`
330-- route-switch benchmark packet -> `Route-switch benchmark verdict`
